Fig. 7.1 compares jet \(p_{\rm T,jet}^{\rm corr,ch}\) spectra from Parametrized Model and STAR data. A good qualitative agreement between the Parametrized Model and the STAR data is apparent. Also the jet area dependency on \(\delta_{pT}\) as shown on Fig. 7.2 exhibits similar qualitative features for the Parametrized Model as for the STAR data.

